NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit, cuDNN, and NCCL
-------------------------------------

CUDA PJRT installations copy NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit and cuDNN runtime libraries
into their dependency directories. The corresponding NVIDIA license texts from
the resolved build dependencies are distributed with the installation as
third_party_licenses/NVIDIA_CUDA_TOOLKIT_LICENSE and
third_party_licenses/NVIDIA_CUDNN_LICENSE. These components are separately
licensed and are not covered by the Apache-2.0 license distributed with
chemtrain-deploy.

