DLPack
------

The public DLPack ABI header is a reduced, modified form of the DLPack 1.3
header at commit 77aafa4d3b0f80feffce9ad4c718dd26751ee0e4. It retains the
legacy tensor structures used by the JCN ABI and omits definitions that the
connector does not expose.

Copyright (c) 2017 - by Contributors

Upstream source: https://github.com/dmlc/dlpack

